# Input

```mdx
import {Link, Badge, Card, Tip, Chart} from './components.js'

See <Link href="https://example.com/docs/getting-started" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the docs</Link> for details.

Total: {formatCurrency(order.items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price * item.quantity, 0), "EUR")}

A short one: <Badge   color='green' /> and {  value  }.

- An item with <Badge   color='green' />
- An item with <Card title="A rather long title for the card" description="And a long description too" />

> A quote with {  value  } and <Tip type="warning" message="Remember to check the configuration before deploying" />

<Chart data={[1, 2, 3]} title="A long block-level tag that is formatted across lines" description="because it stands alone" />

This sentence is just long enough to wrap {count}

Two tags close this paragraph, see <A /> <B />

A paragraph
split over
lines with {an} expression and <C /> tag.

```


